    "Actions are assortments S in a feasible family of subsets of N items; learner observes the discrete choice Y_t in S ∪ {0} (multinomial choice feedback, richer than revenue only)",
    "Joint objective: cumulative regret plus post-hoc estimation error of revenue contrasts R(S_a)-R(S_b)",
    "Parametric choice model p_theta(.|S) with predictable score MGF proxies Sigma_t and per-round curvature proxies Gamma_t >= rho Sigma_t (Assumptions 4.2-4.3); learner knows these proxies and rho",
