   ],
   "definition_quote": "At each round $t=1,\\dots,T$, the learner chooses an assortment $S_t \\in \\St$ and then observes a choice outcome $Y_t \\in S_t \\cup \\{0\\}$, where $0$ denotes the outside option. Choices follow a parametric model $\\{p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid S): \\theta \\in \\Theta \\subset \\R^d\\}$"
  },
